    text Bulma supports the following native HTML form elements: <form> <button> <input> <textarea> and <label>. @36,420,675,40
    text The following CSS classes are supported: @36,472,675,21
    text label @36,505,675,20
    text input @36,537,675,20
    text textarea @36,569,675,21
    text select @36,602,675,20
    text checkbox @36,634,675,20
    text radio @36,666,675,20
    text button @36,698,675,21
    text help @36,731,675,20
    text To maintain an evenly balanced design, Bulma provides a very useful control container with which you can wrap the form controls. When combining several controls in a form, use the field class as a container, to keep the spacing consistent. @36,763,675,61
