    text HTML @36,2927,675,21
    text <div class="field"> <label class="label">Name</label> <div class="control"> <input class="input" type="text" placeholder="e.g Alex Smith"> </div> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="label">Email</label> <div class="control"> <input class="input" type="email" placeholder="e.g. alexsmith@gmail.com"> </div> </div> @36,2960,675,81
    button Copy danger @36,3053,675,36
    h3 "Form control #" @36,3101,675,19
    text The Bulma control is a versatile block container meant to enhance single form controls. Because it has the same height as the element that it wraps, it can only contain the following Bulma elements: @36,3132,675,40
    text input @36,3184,675,21
    text select @36,3217,675,20
    text button @36,3249,675,20
    text icon @36,3281,675,21
    text This container gives the ability to: @36,3314,675,20
    text keep the spacing consistent @36,3346,675,20
    text combine form controls into a group @36,3378,675,21
    text combine form controls into a list @36,3411,675,20
    text append and prepend icons to a form control @36,3443,675,20
    text Example @36,3475,675,20
    field "Text input" @36,3507,675,58
    text HTML @36,3577,675,20
    text <div class="control"> <input class="input" type="text" placeholder="Text input"> </div> @36,3609,675,21
    button Copy danger @36,3642,675,36
    text Example @36,3690,675,20
    select Select *"Select dropdown" "With options" @36,3722,675,55
    text HTML @36,3789,675,21
