    h3 "With icons #" @36,4116,675,19
    text You can append one of 2 modifiers on a control: @36,4147,675,20
    text has-icons-left @36,4179,675,20
    text and/or has-icons-right @36,4211,675,21
    text You also need to add a modifier on the icon: @36,4244,675,20
    text icon is-left if has-icons-left is used @36,4276,675,20
    text icon is-right if has-icons-right is used @36,4308,675,21
    text Make sure the input is the control's first child, otherwise the icon may disappear when selected. The size of the input will define the size of the icon container. @36,4341,675,40
    text Example @36,4393,675,21
    field Email email @36,4426,675,57
